<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Karox eSIM</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Karox eSIM — eSIM, Telegram Premium и Stars по лучшим ценам. Выдача за минуты, поддержка на связи."
  >

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
                   Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #062b52 0%, #05070b 45%);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(600px, calc(100% - 28px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 0;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(9, 13, 20, 0.94);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 153, 255, 0.25);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 80px rgba(0, 119, 255, 0.12);
    }

    .logo {
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      margin: 0 auto 22px;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;

      border-radius: 22px;

      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #008cff, #0057ff);

      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 900;

      box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(0, 132, 255, 0.35);
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      text-align: center;

      font-size: 42px;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    }

    .brand {
      text-align: center;
      color: #20a9ff;

      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;

      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .description {
      text-align: center;

      color: #aeb7c4;

      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.5;

      margin: 18px auto 28px;
    }

    .buttons {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .button {
      min-height: 60px;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;

      padding: 0 20px;

      border-radius: 16px;

      text-decoration: none;
      color: white;

      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 800;

      background: #0787f9;

      transition: 0.2s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      filter: brightness(1.08);
    }

    .button.secondary {
      background: #151b25;
      border: 1px solid #293544;
    }

    .arrow {
      font-size: 22px;
      opacity: .7;
    }

    .info {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;

      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .info-item {
      padding: 15px 8px;

      text-align: center;

      background: #0e141d;
      border: 1px solid #1d2734;

      border-radius: 14px;

      color: #b8c1cc;

      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .info-item strong {
      display: block;

      color: white;

      font-size: 14px;

      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .telegram {
      margin-top: 26px;

      text-align: center;

      color: #687383;

      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .telegram span {
      color: #159fff;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;

      margin-top: 20px;

      color: #4f5967;

      font-size: 12px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 500px) {
      .container {
        padding: 20px 0;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 28px 18px;
        border-radius: 22px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 36px;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 21px;
      }

      .description {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .info-item {
        font-size: 11px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">

    <div class="card">

      <div class="logo">
        K
      </div>

      <h1>Karox</h1>

      <div class="brand">
        eSIM
      </div>

      <p class="description">
        💎 eSIM, Telegram Premium и Stars
        по лучшим ценам.<br>
        Выдача за минуты, поддержка на связи.
      </p>

      <div class="buttons">

        <a
          class="button"
          href="https://t.me/Karox_eSIM_bot"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          <span>💎 Получить eSIM</span>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <a
          class="button secondary"
          href="https://t.me/Karox_eSIM_bot"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          <span>Telegram Premium</span>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <a
          class="button secondary"
          href="https://t.me/Karox_eSIM_bot"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          <span>Telegram Stars</span>
          <span class="arrow">→</span>
        </a>

      </div>

      <div class="info">

        <div class="info-item">
          <strong>⚡ Быстро</strong>
          Выдача за минуты
        </div>

        <div class="info-item">
          <strong>💎 Выгодно</strong>
          Лучшие цены
        </div>

        <div class="info-item">
          <strong>💬 Поддержка</strong>
          Всегда на связи
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="telegram">
        Покупка и получение услуг через
        <span>@Karox_eSIM_bot</span>
      </div>

    </div>

    <footer>
      © 2026 Karox
    </footer>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
